  ("0-3","SUN","If you eat peanut butter every morning for protein, sweetheart, you're eating a sauce.","PB: A SAUCE, NOT PROTEIN",f"{K} | two level tablespoons of peanut butter onto a digital scale | overhead CU"),
  ("3-10","SUN","Two tablespoons is about 190 calories for seven grams. Tasty. Not a protein plan.","~190 cal · ~7 g protein","same | scale readout graphic | CU"),
