  ("17-30","SUN","Toast with peanut butter, seven. Plus a glass of milk, eight. Plus a boiled egg, six. Plus the toast itself, four. Twenty-five.","PB 7 + milk 8 + egg 6 + toast 4 = 25 g","same | plate builds, gram counter | overhead"),
  ("30-36","SUN","Peanut allergy in the house? Obviously skip. Kidney disease? Ask your doctor for your number.","Allergy? Skip. Kidneys? Ask.","same | CU | CU"),
  ("36-40","CHANG","I eat it from the jar.","","same | Chang, spoon in the jar | two-shot"),
  ("40-45","SUN","I know. Comment SOUP for real protein.","Comment SOUP","same | takes the jar away | two-shot"),
