  ("33-39","SUN","Adding lots of fiber fast? Go slowly, drink water.","Go slowly · drink water","same | CU | CU"),
  ("39-45","SUN","Comment GUT for my fiber ladder. Drink the water too.","Comment GUT","same | drinks the water, berries and all | medium"),
