  ("0-3","SUN","If you buy the little fruit yogurts every week, flip one. Read one number.","FLIP IT · READ PROTEIN",f"{K} | Sun flips a yogurt tub, glasses on, finger on the label | CU"),
  ("3-10","SUN","Plain Greek: about fifteen grams in three quarters of a cup. The fruity one in the little cup: often half that, plus sugar.","Plain Greek ¾ cup ≈ 15 g","same | two containers side by side | CU"),
