 caption="Comment TEST for the free Strength Age check.\nCarry your own groceries: bags close to your body, stand tall, breathe normally, two trips if heavy. Grip is a window into whole-body strength: in 142,861 adults (Lancet 2015), people with stronger grip tended to have longer lives.\nHernia or recent shoulder/hand surgery? Light bags until your doctor says so.",
