  ("0-3","SUN","Your friend who stopped coming to church. Or cards. Or walking. Call her today.","CALL HER TODAY",f"{LJ} | Sun opens a worn paper address book beside an old landline | CU"),
  ("3-9","SUN","Not a text. A call. Texts are for 'running late'.","Not a text. A call.","same | dials | CU"),
  ("9-19","SUN","In 148 studies of 308,849 people, those with strong social ties tended to have longer lives. A link as strong as smoking's.","148 studies · 308,849 people · linked","same | study card inset (Holt-Lunstad, PLoS Med 2010) | medium"),
