 caption="Comment BEGIN and tell Sun her first name.\nIn a PLoS Medicine meta-analysis (148 studies, 308,849 people), people with stronger social relationships tended to have longer lives; the link was comparable in size to well-known factors like smoking. Call, don't text: 'I noticed you're gone. I miss you. Tuesday, soup, my house.'\nCan't reach her for days and you're worried? Call her family or ask for a wellness check.",
