  ("12-24","SUN","The rule: scoot to the edge. Pump your ankles ten times. Breathe out and stand, hand on the couch arm. Count to five before you walk.","Scoot · 10 ankle pumps · stand · count 5","same | Sun demonstrates each step | medium-full"),
