 caption="Comment BALANCE for Steady Feet.\nThe couch rule: scoot to the edge, 10 ankle pumps, stand with a hand on the couch arm, count to five before walking. Orthostatic hypotension, a blood-pressure drop on standing, was found in about 22% of community-dwelling older adults in a meta-analysis; some medicines raise the risk. Don't change them; tell your doctor.\nFainted or hit your head? Get checked today.",
